<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan firms set cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan firms set cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bacnotan Consolidated Inc and its subsidiary Bacnotan Cement Corp separately said on Friday their respective boards had declared 25 centavo cash dividends to their sharesholders as of January 30.</p>
<p>The dividends will be paid on February 18, corporate secretary Juan Diaz of both companies told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend is on January 21.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
